# First Notes on String 5 (repertoire plan: st-first-notes-string-5). An original study in A
# minor, low and march-like: the open string 5 (A), fret 2 (B) with finger 2, fret 3 (C) with
# finger 3. The teacher strums Am and E7: B sits in E7, A and C in Am. The last bar turns from E7
# back to Am halfway through and ends on A.
